Multiple pages split at measured lines, retain all paragraphs and have deterministic numbered output paths.
-- input.1 --
.TH TOOL 1
.SH NAME
tool \- paginate
.SH DESCRIPTION
First paragraph with some useful words.
.PP
Second paragraph with more useful words.
.PP
Third paragraph with several useful words.
.PP
Fourth paragraph with more useful words.
.PP
Fifth paragraph with more useful words.
.PP
Sixth paragraph with more useful words.
.PP
Seventh paragraph with more useful words.
.PP
Eighth paragraph with more useful words.
-- options.json --
{"Width":400,"PageHeight":300,"Margin":24}
